Hello,

My name is [Your Full Name], date of birth [MM/DD/YYYY]. I am requesting a copy/verification of my Social Security record / a replacement Social Security card issued in my name. For security, I am listing only the last four digits of the number here: SSN ending in 1234. Please let me know the next steps and which documents I must provide (for example: government-issued photo ID, birth certificate, proof of address). 

I prefer to provide my full SSN via [secure portal/phone/in person] — please confirm the secure method you require. Also tell me the expected processing time and delivery options.

Thank you,
[Your Full Name]  
[Phone] | [Email] | [Current Address]

