I am requesting a copy/verification of my Social Security record (or a replacement card). Name: [Your Full Name]; DOB: [MM/DD/YYYY]; SSN (last 4): 1234. Please advise which documents I must provide and whether I need to complete Form SS‑5, visit a local office, or submit information online. I will provide the full SSN and identity documents by your required secure method.

Please contact me at [phone] or [email] to schedule any appointment or to confirm submission instructions.

Sincerely,  
[Your Full Name]  
[Signature if printed]

