“Hello — my name is [Full Name], DOB [MM/DD/YYYY]. I’m calling to request a copy/verification of my Social Security record / a replacement card. My SSN ends in 1234. What documents do you need, and how should I provide my full SSN securely (online portal, in person, or over a verified phone number)? Also, what is your current processing time and delivery method?”

