What to include
- Your full legal name (and any former/maiden names).
- Date and place of birth.
- Last four digits of SSN (initially) and offer to provide the full SSN securely.
- Current mailing address and daytime phone or email.
- Reason you need the copy (e.g., replacement card, verification for employer, records).
- List of documents you will attach or bring (acceptable ID: driver’s license, passport, birth certificate; see SSA for specifics).
- Date and your signature (for letters).

Security note
- Avoid emailing the full SSN. Include only the last four digits in email/initial contact and say you will provide the full SSN by phone, secure portal, or in person.
- Prefer official channels (SSA website, local SSA office, certified mail) or other government agency portals.
- If the recipient asks for the full SSN by email, confirm a secure method first.

