Subject: Request for SSN verification / replacement card (SSN ending in 1234)

Dear Sir or Madam,

I am writing to request verification of my Social Security Number and guidance on obtaining a replacement card. My identifying information is below:

- Full legal name: [Your full name]  
- Date of birth: [MM/DD/YYYY]  
- SSN: ending in 1234  
- Current address: [Street, City, State, ZIP]  
- Phone: [Best contact number]  
