Security & process tips
- Check the issuing authority’s official website (for example, the Social Security Administration in the U.S.) for exact requirements and secure submission options.  
- Avoid sending your full SSN in plain email. If you must start by email, include only the last four digits and ask how to provide full verification securely.  
